/*
 * The `document` node: the root of every rendered Markdoc body.
 *
 * Astro's default renders `<article>` here. That is a decision the content file
 * is in no position to make — see NODE_COMPONENTS in src/lib/markdoc-tags.ts —
 * so this renders a styling hook and nothing else, and each template wraps the
 * body in whatever landmark the page actually is.
 */
---

<div class="prose"><slot /></div>
